# Customize Your 2-Frame Tower Setup

Excellent selection! You've chosen our balanced 2-Frame Tower, perfect for small spaces with a compact footprint of 0.5m² and height of 1m — offering hybrid setups and yields of ~5-10kg/year across two stackable units. 

To get started with customization, let's configure the first frame: decide how to divide it into modules. Each module serves as a dedicated growing space.
